          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "AuditReadyBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "End Chat"
      }
    },
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Unauthenticated on purpose: a health probe that needs a secret is not a health probe.\n\nThe container's HEALTHCHECK and any orchestrator call this, so it must\nanswer before a credential exists. It reports `auth` so \"is this deployment\nopen to anyone?\" is answerable without reading someone's environment.",
